helptext      = _("\
The Trireme is your first boat unit. It can act\
 as a transport ship, and unlike later boats can\
 travel on rivers, but it may not enter deep ocean\
 tiles. It cannot attack other ships, though it\
 may still defend itself when attacked.\
")

